Z||000005||Raydar||02-06-2001||03:27 PM||||See Tina's earlier post regarding the exploding 4-speed. Adds a whole new meaning to "splitting the cases". <BR>That was done with a N/A 383.<BR>If you're gonna do a supercharger, I might suggest a scattershield and a tranny blanket of some sort. <BR>Actually, I <I>am</I> kidding. <BR>It might be neat to do, but very expensive and not real practical.<BR>But hey, it's your car! <BR>Just be sure to duck.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  <P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<P>88 T-top Formula<BR>88 soon-to-be-V6 coupe||||reg||1
